            "pub_date": "2026-11-19 12:12:18",
            "source": "bastillepost",
            "kind": 2,
            "language": "zh-HK"
        },
        {
            "title": "信達生物逆市反彈 合作伙伴獲強生收購消息發酵",
            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">港股早市顯著再挫，逆市報升的藍籌僅10多隻，信達生物(01801)是其中之一，似是受惠合作伙伴獲強生收購的消息發酵帶動。</p>\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">截至上午約11時47分，信達生物升2.7%，報85.75元，成交3.72億元；稍早前該股最高見85.8元，當時升幅2.75%。</p>\n</div>",
            "link": "https://www.bastillepost.com/hongkong/article/17214954-%e4%bf%a1%e9%81%94%e7%94%9f%e7%89%a9%e9%80%86%e5%b8%82%e5%8f%8d%e5%bd%88-%e5%90%88%e4%bd%9c%e4%bc%99%e4%bc%b4%e7%8d%b2%e5%bc%b7%e7%94%9f%e6%94%b6%e8%b3%bc%e6%b6%88%e6%81%af%e7%99%bc%e9%85%b5",
