            "description": "<div class=\"article-body\">\n<p class=\"font-size-scaler-control\" data-font=\"16\" style=\"font-weight: 400;\">日股早市反覆微升，日經平均指數中午收壣59,140點，升116點或0.2%。</p>\n</div>",
